    "message": "Guidelines require glucose screening for patients transitioning to DTG who have 2 or more risk factors for hyperglycaemia: age ≥30, family history of DM, BMI ≥25 kg/m². This patient has all three risk factors (age 36, mother with Type 2 Diabetes, BMI 32.4). Fasting glucose (118 mg/dL) and HbA1c (6.1%) confirm impaired fasting glucose and pre-diabetes. No clinician plan was documented for diabetes screening, monitoring, or management despite these results.",
